## Overview

This project reimplements AWQ from scratch and conducts experiments to evaluate whether AWQ's robustness claims are true.

## Planned Experiments

- Domain specific evaluation. We will test perplexity of AWQ, RTN and FP16 on a domain specific test set and observe whether AWQ degrades.
- Calibration ablation study. We'll quantize the model once with generic data, and once with domain specific data, and compare quality on a test set in the domain.

## References

- Lin et al., "AWQ: Activation-aware Weight Quantization for On-Device LLM 
  Compression and Acceleration," MLSys 2024 (Best Paper). 
